// The second half of the keyword list, and the label a row shows.

ed_is_decl2(string s) {
  int ok = 0;
  if (s = "entity" || s = "template" || s = "game" || s = "font") { ok = 1; }
} return int ok;

// "sprite runner" -- the kind and the name, which is what a hierarchy row is.
// Concatenated once per visible row per frame, which is at most thirty short
// strings a frame: nowhere near the loop that makes concatenation a disaster, and
// the alternative (a flat-store build) would be unreadable for the saving.
ed_label(int i) {
  string ret_s = (import ed_kd)[i] + " " + (import ed_nm)[i];
} return string ret_s;
